jc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75363516_2273427456184674_5101230653467287889_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uWIql8BjqzMQ7kNvwE0k2Fj&_nc_oc=AdqLq3tICXT13batDnNHOPomECzap2CvqsXTTDUPxDoqg6WkE9TamlZLYgefSzAoLDM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5gVg6CZjTTUy9l9d4hDsYFY5UbGyUDvP6XdelPx7QGAg&oe=6A184072"}, "display_name": "Fail Factory! Demo", "keywords": ["Puzzle", "Casual", "Arcade", "Physics", "Demo"], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in a whimsical robot factory while climbing your way up the corporate ladder from lowly intern to esteemed star employee. In a wacky spectacle of increasing chaos, strive to keep up with the escalating comedy of errors as you operate various assembly lines in a myriad of mini-games. Entrenched in a physics-based, no consequences playground, experience three main types of mini-game stations, all with the goal to help the factory build robots on a massive scale. \n \nWorking in assembly stations, sorting stations and quality assurance protocol (QAP), where you\u2019ll control unfathomably large robots, you\u2019ll hone your skills in a factory that feels reactive and alive, allowing for a fully immersive experience. Designed with approachability in mind, ridiculous failure is inevitable as you work your way to the top in this vibrant, witty and comedic stress-inducing Fail Factory!.", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in a whimsical robot factory while climbing your way up the corporate ladder from lowly intern to esteemed star employee. In a wacky spectacle of increasing chaos, strive to keep up with the escalating comedy of errors as you operate various assembly lines in a myriad of mini-games. Entrenched in a physics-based, no consequences playground, experience three main types of mini-game stations, all with the goal to help the factory build robots on a massive scale."}]}, "developer_name": "Armature Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.meta.com/legal/priv